# Native folders are GENERATED by `expo prebuild`, never committed (CNG).
#
# The custom native bits are not hand-maintained in android/ — they are emitted
# by config plugins, so a prebuild reproduces them exactly:
#   plugins/withCallKeep.js  -> CallForegroundService{,Module,Package}.kt,
#                               MainApplication.kt, LiveKitReactNative.setup()
#   plugins/withAsyncStorageRepo.js
#
# Consequence: edit the plugins, not android/. Anything you change directly in
# android/ is wiped by the next prebuild and is invisible in review.
#
# EAS Build runs prebuild itself; `npx expo run:android` runs it on demand.
#
# The `/android` line below is load-bearing, not tidiness: Expo decides bare vs
# CNG by checking whether the native dir exists AND is untracked. Un-ignoring it
# flips the project back to bare, where `runtimeVersion` policies are rejected
# and `expo start` refuses to serve a manifest to the dev client.
/android
/ios

# local build/lint timing logs and export checks
.duration-*.log
/.pwa-video-check/
